k is assembled, filled with challenging enemy encounters and intriguing events. After each confrontation, you'll face a crucial decision: choose from three randomly drawn dungeon cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you fight an enemy  to hone your skills and reap valuable rewards? Or will you seek out the merchant, eager to acquire new equipment and bolster your arsenal for the battles ahead?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering the art of choosing the right dungeon card at the right time is paramount to overcoming the formidable Ulag'Bol and achieving your ultimate revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402160/extras/7e136f146cdc190593ec79b9134e1348.avif?t=1743514652\" width=730 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402160/extras/ce62b9f26ebd7783565b146233b28351.webp?t=1743514652\" width=440 height=60 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock exciting new challenges after successful runs! These modes offer unique twists and increased difficulty, pushing your skills to the limit. Prove your strength and master the game with progressively harder challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable Cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn powerful new cards for each class with every playthrough! These cards unlock fresh strategic possibilities, allowing you to refine existing builds or experiment with innovative deck compositions.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a quest of revenge against the dark lord Ulag'Bol in this dungeon-crawling deckbuilder! Choose your class and starting deck, then delve into a three-act roguelike adventure. Collect powerful cards and equipment to unlock devastating synergies and defeat Ulag'Bol and claim your freedom!",
